      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It can be hard to read the framerate when you're moving the camera around that much! :P\nEither way, I was unable to replicate using a seperate program to monitor and graph framerate and frametime. I saw no change in frametime when opening the QM after scrolling through ~3000 world results.\nIf you want to replicate with more reliable tools, that'd be useful. Frametime graphs are what we're most interested in with this kind of issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
