      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: Yeah, I didn't even think about how bad that camera movement was.\nHere's another repro with a framerate & frametime graph attached. \nSame exact setup. You'll see after the first batch of worlds, it dips from holding 90 to ~70. Second batch doesn't have much more of an impact. Third batch dips it to ~50. \nhttps://streamable.com/xis25n\nIf streamable compression is getting in the way, I can upload somewhere else.\nAnd for good measure, here's the clip from last night that led me to investigate this. This was after a ~4 hour session of world hopping, and extensively looking for worlds that were buried in labs. This doesn't have the repro, but it does show how bad it got https://streamable.com/nl8b4b",
      "viewerReactions": null
