  "details": "After browsing a large number of worlds, the framerate when opening the quickmenu degrades. This degradation does not go away until you reboot the game. \nThe more worlds you browse, the larger this degradation becomes.\nVideo demonstration of the degradation after I browse the world list: \nEdit: cleaner repro video with frametime graph: https://streamable.com/xis25n\n\nYou can see that as I continue to browse more and more worlds, opening the quickmenu impacts my framerate to a larger and larger degree.\n\nSpecs:\nRTX 3080\nAMD R9-5900x\n64GB DDR4 3200 @ CL14\n\n\nI have been unable to reproduce this on live.",
